&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Open Source selling or Cloud first/Product led sales go to market motion a big plus.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
