&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Direct experience selling monitoring/data/visualisation products.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to own a book of business, direct your own and your team&#39;s work and initiatives to exceed your quarterly targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
