&lt;p&gt;In Spain, the Base compensation range for this role is 83,000 EU - 104,000 EU. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed in the interview process. Benefits include equity, bonus (if applicable) and other benefits listed &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://grafana.com/about/careers/#jobs&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://grafana.com/about/careers/#jobs&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
