&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs, the company behind the open observability cloud, is founded on the principles of open source, open standards, open ecosystems, and open culture. Grafana Cloud, our fully managed observability platform, is flexible and built for scale. With Grafana Cloud&#39;s actually useful AI, organizations can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data to move at the speed of their ambitions. Today, more than 35 million users and 7,000+ customers – including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce – trust Grafana Labs to ensure reliability of their applications and systems, resolve incidents quickly, and optimize their telemetry to reduce noise and cost. We are a 100% remote company with 1,600+ team members across 40+ countries, and we’re backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a senior, AI-native demand generation marketer to own and evolve our lifecycle nurture programs. You&#39;ll take a program with proven ROI to its next phase: deeper personalization, continuous optimization, and bigger business impact at scale. This role blends AI-driven program design, multi-channel execution, and the influence to set the standard for how AI-native marketing works across our GTM teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re in the early innings of a massive opportunity. &lt;/strong&gt;Grafana is the open observability platform, trusted by 35M+ users and 7K+ customers worldwide, and usage-based cloud and open-source adoption is still just scratching the surface of enterprise observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This team is Grafana&#39;s center of excellence for AI-native marketing&lt;/strong&gt;. The playbooks built here surface across the org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native lifecycle marketing at scale is an evolving playbook&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll write it, with the autonomy to build the bold and the experimental.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll partner directly with GTM leadership across marketing, sales, and operations&lt;/strong&gt;, owning shared outcomes and business impact of campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate on the AI-native lifecycle marketing strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; Set the standards, playbooks, and best practices other GTM programs adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own our AI email machine.&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the next phase of Grafana&#39;s AI nurture engine, generating personalized emails at scale tuned to each user&#39;s journey, woven together with web, and paid lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize continuously.&lt;/strong&gt; Evolve our programs over time, using AI and thoughtful prompt engineering to surface patterns and turn them into lift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the cross-functional center.&lt;/strong&gt; Surface pipeline signals that show the impact on shared outcomes across org lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find the gaps first.&lt;/strong&gt; Form hypotheses, run experiments, and build new capabilities for the org, not just incremental lift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; in B2B SaaS demand generation or growth marketing, ideally in a technical or developer-focused product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-program ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; A track record owning multiple programs or a channel strategy end to end across email nurture, web, and paid, not a single program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI workflow ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; Repeatable AI systems you&#39;ve built that still run, with a current working example you can walk through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; Salesforce, marketing analytics, and multi-touch attribution across a PLG + commercial motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A capability you multiplied.&lt;/strong&gt; A standard, playbook, or workflow other marketers adopted and still use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong communicator.&lt;/strong&gt; You frame results as business impact and bring a recommendation with the reasoning behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
