&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In the UK, the base compensation range for this role is GBP 91,755&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;- GBP 110,106&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
